            "sid": "ISA 63:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ana ŵani soni ŵakutyocela ku Edomuju, ali awete yecejewu ya mu msinda wakwe Bosila? Ana ŵani ŵeleŵa ŵawete yakuwala yakusalala, ŵakwenda mwakulilapilila pa macili gakwe?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
