    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 63:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Uneji, jwakuŵeceta ya cilungamo, nambo soni jwamacili gakuti mpaka kulupusya.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 63:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 63:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nambi uli yakuwala yenu yigambile kuti pyuu, nipo soni yikuwoneka mpela ya mundu jwakuminya yisogosi ya mpeleya?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 63:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 63:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Naliŵatile jika ŵandu ŵa mitundu jine",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " mpela yisogosi ya mipeleya, nipo pangali atamose jumo juŵayice kukungamucisya. Naliwete ndili ndumbile, soni miasi jawo jagwilile pa yakuwala yangu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.14.20"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ciw 14:20",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.19.13"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "19:13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.19.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 63:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu mtima mwangu nasimicisye kuti liyice lisiku lyakuti mbelece cilango cakupweteka kwa amagongo ŵangu, soni kuti ciyice caka cakuti ngulupusye ŵandu ŵangu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 63:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nalolesisye nambo paliji pangali jwakungamucisya. Nasimonjile mnope kuti paliji pangali jwakulimbikasya. Myoyo napundile ni macili ga une jikape, cicaliji kulimbikasya mnope caliji lutumbilo lwangu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.59.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yes 59:16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 63:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naliŵatile ŵandu ŵa mitundu jine ndili jwamtumbile, nipo najipungulile miasi jawo pasi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Umbone wa AMBUJE kwa Aisalaeli",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 63:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 63:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AMBUJE",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " ŵatite kuti, “Jemanja mli ŵandu ŵangu, ŵanace ŵangu ŵele ngasimulambusya.” Myoyo ŵakulupwisye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 63:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŵalasile pakuyiwona yisawusyo yawo yosope. Lilayika lyakutyocela kwa ŵalakwe lyakulupwisye. Ŵawombwele mwa cinonyelo ni kusalala mtima kwawo. Aŵele alimkwakamucisya mpela ŵanace kutandila kalakala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 63:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nambope jemanja mwamjimucile, nikumtumbilisya Msimu Ŵaswela. Myoyo AMBUJE ŵaŵele amagongo ŵawo, nipo ŵamenyene nawo ngondo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 63:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 63:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pelepo ŵanduwo ŵakumbucile yakalakala, masiku ga Mose",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " jwakutumicila jwa AMBUJE, nipo ŵawusisye kuti, “Ana sambano ali kwapi sambano AMBUJEWO uŵakulupwisye ŵandu ŵawo pamo ni jwakwalongolela pa nyasa? Ali kwapi AMBUJEWO uŵaŵisile mu ŵandu ŵakwe Msimu wawo Ŵaswela? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 63:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ali kwapi AMBUJEWO uŵatesile yindu yakusimonjesya ni macili gawo gamakulungwa kupitila mwa Mose?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.12+ISA.63.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.12",
              "ISA.63.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.14.21"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Eks 14:21",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 63:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŵagagaŵenye mesi ga m'nyasa, ŵandu ŵawo alimkulola, kuti lina lyawo lipikanice mpaka ndaŵi syangamala. Ŵajombwesye pa nyasa pejumu, nipo mpela haci jakwenda mcipululu, jemanja nganimkuŵala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.12+ISA.63.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.12",
              "ISA.63.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 63:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Msimu wa AMBUJE wapumulisye, mpela musikusapumulila ng'ombe ku ciŵata. Myoyo m'mwe AMBUJE mwalongolele ŵandu ŵenu kuti lina lyenu licimbicikwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Lipopelo lyakuŵenda canasa ni cikamucisyo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 63:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 63:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wawo AMBUJE kwinaniko, ku malo gawo geswela ni ga ucimbicimbi, atuloleje uwe. Ana cinonyelo cawo cili kwapi? Ana macili gawo gali kwapi? Ngakutulosya cinonyelo cawo ni canasa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 63:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wawo ali Atati ŵetu nditu, atamose Abulahamu",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " ngakutumanyilila, atamose Isalaeli ngakutujiticisya. Nambo Wawo, AMBUJE, ali Atati ŵetu, wawo ali mkulupusyo jwetu kutandila kalakala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 63:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ana ligongo cici akututenda kuti tusokonecele pa matala gawo? Uli akutukunda kuti tuŵeje ŵakumula mitima mwakuti ngatukwajogopa soni? Awujile ligongo lya ŵakutumicila ŵawo, mitundu jakusagulidwa ja ŵandu ŵawo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
